The Giant Traveling Fortress of Condolo created solely for the purpose of crossing the strong magic region.

43
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:34,840
It sure is coming in handy, huh?

44
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:41,240
But these people are way too weak. They run out of magic powers so quickly. They're trash.

45
