49
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:14,180
Don't worry about that, Loro Petchka. Anyway, Spade's forces are drawing closer, aren't they?

50
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:17,740
Indeed. It won't be long before they make it to the border.

51
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:27,420
They've done great damage in the last six months. Diamond's essentially been taken over. Both our own nation and the Clover Kingdom currently stand in harm's way.

52
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:33,480
So in spite of all that preparation we've been doing, they're still one step ahead of us?

53
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,820
Well, I'm ready for a fight whenever.

54
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:43,540
Good. Then I'd like to send a team to the strong magic region. That's where their forces are now. We can ambush them.

55
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:50,200
I think timing is going to play a big role here. It might be easier to win if we can draw them in closer to us.

56
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:58,100
They're crossing a strong magic region, so I'm sure they'll be worn down when they get here. That'll be the time to strike.

57
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:05,940
Actually, I doubt they'll be weakened by the trip at all. Apparently they're going to arrive in some sort of traveling fortress.

58
