66
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:47,840
The only people who would normally be expected to obtain meaningful results from this training are the ones who are loved by mana and experienced higher stage mages.

67
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:53,900
Asta has no magic at all, and yet he's improved by a surprising amount during the time he spent with us.

68
00:04:55,360 --> 00:05:01,620
It's great that he's at the arcane stage, but I was even more impressed by his hard work and refusal to give up.

69
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:10,540
