75
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,960
When you're just a piece of low-stage trash.

76
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:41,480
Pathetic weaklings like you can't even muster any attack spells.

77
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:47,140
