78
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:53,500
So if you scum know what's best for you, then you'll do as we say.

79
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:57,320
If you ask me, you're getting off easy.

80
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,100
I mean, you're not gonna die.

81
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:01,220
Not till your mana runs out anyway.

82
