Let's see.

83
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:10,400
I think you'll be the lucky young lady who gets to go next.

84
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:12,660
No!

85
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:17,820
You're actually about to be useful for once in your pitiful little life.

86
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,900
