101
00:07:12,180 --> 00:07:13,920
How stupid can one guy be?

102
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:17,560
I don't know what you're trying to do, but you're wasting your time.

103
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:19,880
I'll stop you in your tracks, kid!

104
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,400
Now die!

105
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:29,440
The only person wasting time here is you.

106
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:35,000
Even if I'm outnumbered, I'm gonna take every last one of you down.

107
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:38,320
So you might as well come at me all at once!

108
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,840
You little brats!

109
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,980
Who the hell are you?

110
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:46,140
Who the hell are you going to do?

111
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:46,320
Who the hell are you going to do?

112
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:46,920
Who the hell are you going to do?

113
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,220
What?

114
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:47,860
Okay.

115
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:49,720
