116
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,680
I'm a member of the Magic Knights.

117
00:07:52,220 --> 00:07:53,160
Black Bulls.

118
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:55,140
I came here to help you guys get away.

119
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:56,900
So don't worry.

120
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,120
