125
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:12,740
She's completely terrified.

126
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:16,400
We can never leave this fortress.

127
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,720
Even if we're set free,

128
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:23,760
