129
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:27,080
Why is this happening?

130
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:30,860
None of us ever wanted our kingdom to be part of this war.

131
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,980
These poor people.

132
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,340
