We'll stop you!

144
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,240
Dweller, down!

145
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,340
Black, slack!

146
00:09:14,340 --> 00:09:19,380
Up there.

147
00:09:19,380 --> 00:09:23,760
What the?

148
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:28,540
Your return!

149
00:09:40,540 --> 00:09:41,040
What?

150
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:44,880
Who the hell is this guy?

151
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:51,440
Let's see. It must be there.

152
00:09:57,080 --> 00:10:00,460
You just had to show up here and make a mess of things, didn't you?

153
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:04,560
From the looks of you, I assume you also have the power of a devil.

154
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:09,360
Your people are terrified. How could you torture them like this?

155
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,540
Torture them? Not at all.

156
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:15,480
They're sacrificing themselves in service.

157
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:19,920
They're nothing but trash, so this is the best fate they could have asked for.

158
00:10:20,300 --> 00:10:22,260
Your people are not trash!

159
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:27,240
My body!

160
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:38,000
I don't know how Monolith's filth like you managed to get your pitiful hands on the devil's power,

161
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:41,720
