162
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:45,620
You're no match for a higher-level mage such as myself.

163
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:48,560
Poison creation magic.

164
00:10:49,060 --> 00:10:50,280
Basilisk breath.

165
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:51,940
You're worthless.

166
00:10:52,660 --> 00:10:54,980
You won't even make suitable food for this creature.

167
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,240
Destroyer!

168
00:10:57,240 --> 00:11:03,680
What? No. How?

169
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:06,000
He erased the poison?

170
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:10,820
How could a worm like him be so strong?

171
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:13,180
You may have a devil's power,

172
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:16,640
