173
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:20,300
Sacrificing your people to help your kingdom?

174
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:21,800
That's bull.

175
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:24,460
If you want to fight so badly,

176
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:28,060
I'll give you all the fight you want!

177
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:47,380
He's making a mess as usual.

178
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:48,880
That idiot.

179
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:57,540
How the heck did he do that?

180
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,580
Alright, I took care of the big guy.

181
00:11:59,940 --> 00:12:01,740
And I wiped out his little buddies, too.

182
00:12:02,060 --> 00:12:02,920
You're all safe now.

183
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,660
I don't believe it.

184
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:04,880
Seriously?

185
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,280
Hey, look who's here!

186
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:11,620
Man, Noelle's water armor is so cool.

187
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:15,060
And now she can use that bubble thing at the same time?

188
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:16,520
She's gotten way stronger!

189
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:23,620
Look, just for the record,

190
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:28,280
using a transport spell while moving through a strong magic region is really difficult.

191
00:12:29,380 --> 00:12:31,100
We realize that, Noelle.

192
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:33,280
Thanks for getting everyone here safely.

193
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:35,080
You did a wonderful job.

194
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,100
Truly, it was quite impressive.

195
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:39,380
Hey, don't patronize me.

196
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:40,980
I'm royalty, you know.

197
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,660
Uh, yeah, so am I.

198
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,760
What's the big idea, stupid?

199
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:49,800
Who said you could go barreling out of that meeting and leave us in the dust like that?

200
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,720
I mean, that's pretty typical for him.

201
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,680
You could have at least taken me along with you.

202
00:12:54,680 --> 00:13:00,000
Wow, the excitement of being with Noelle and Mimosa almost killed me.

203
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,480
Wait, no it didn't.

204
00:13:01,780 --> 00:13:02,860
I wasn't excited at all.

205
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:05,740
Lady Finnis is the only woman who does that for me now.

206
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:10,440
Oh my, are you all right, miss?

207
00:13:10,700 --> 00:13:12,080
You look like you're distressed.

208
00:13:12,340 --> 00:13:14,320
I only hope you'll allow me to comfort you.

209
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,160
Ugh, stop it!

210
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:17,980
No comforting other ladies!

211
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:19,280
Oh, look, sis.

212
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,000
That man's kind of scary.

213
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,140
You've improved a lot too, Finral!

214
00:13:23,380 --> 00:13:24,900
I'm so proud of you!

215
00:13:25,460 --> 00:13:26,380
Thanks a lot.

216
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:27,380
I'm doing my best.

217
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,100
No way.

218
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,780
Why would you be proud of this loser?

219
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,340
Huh?

220
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:34,880
I still can't believe there's a woman out there who actually agreed to marry you, Finral.

221
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,480
Are you sure that you didn't just imagine her?

222
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,460
I told you she's real!

223
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:40,280
Quit asking!

224
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:43,100
Where'd that come from?

225
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:44,220
What's happening now?

226
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:48,260
I can't replenish your mana, but I can heal you at least.

227
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,160
Plant recovery magic.

228
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:53,540
Princess healing flower paradise.

229
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:54,660
Awesome!

230
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:57,700
You've gotten way better at using your magic too, Mimosa!

231
00:13:58,300 --> 00:13:59,460
Seriously cool!

232
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:01,300
That means a lot, Asta.

233
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:02,340
Thank you.

234
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:03,580
That's amazing.

235
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:04,280
Sounds better.

236
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:05,640
But still.

237
00:14:08,500 --> 00:14:12,380
The place that all of you came from, it was taken over?

238
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:14,160
That's right.

239
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:17,460
Our village was attacked.

240
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:22,860
One night, the army suddenly showed up with no warning at all.

241
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:27,000
Anyone who defied them was killed on the spot.

242
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:34,720
If we tried to go back, they'd probably execute us for escaping.

243
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,480
There's no need to worry.

244
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:43,440
No need?

245
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:45,100
We'll fix this.

246
00:14:45,100 --> 00:14:47,020
Our friends are on their way there.

247
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:51,840
Running off without a plan?

248
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,460
That moron!

249
00:14:53,860 --> 00:14:55,480
We should follow Asta's lead.

250
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:58,280
Yeah, no way am I gonna let him get all the action!

251
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:01,660
She's not very regal.

252
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:03,900
Then again, she is in PJs.

253
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:04,860
No.

254
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:06,880
I'd rather you not follow him.

255
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:08,920
I have a different job for you two.

256
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:11,500
This is our chance.

257
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:15,620
I want you to help me take over the Spade Kingdom's outlying base.

258
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:21,400
Now, Finral, Noelle, and Mimosa, please go and provide backup for Asta.

259
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:22,820
Um, sorry.

260
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:26,300
It's just, I'm not sure it's a good idea to split us up.

261
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:28,880
It'll be all right.

262
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,940
You've all trained hard.

263
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:32,400
You can do this.

264
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:40,700
Man, this is such a waste of time.

265
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:43,800
Why did we have to get stuck watching over this stupid village?

266
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,220
Hey, keep your voice down, would you?

267
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:47,320
If the captain hears you, we'll all be screwed.

268
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:51,780
An intruder!

269
00:15:51,780 --> 00:15:52,300
Shoot!

270
00:15:52,300 --> 00:16:07,920
I was told they were all stage two or weaker.

271
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:11,620
So no matter how many there are, we're sure to win!

272
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:16,120
Blade Magic Profound Spiral Flames!

273
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:22,400
No way!

274
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:23,820
Is it over already?

275
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:24,980
I guess so.

276
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:27,620
Sorry there's no one left for you to beat up.

277
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:28,520
Boo.

278
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,180
Okay, we're all done over here.

279
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,180
That fast?

280
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:33,400
What's the matter, Asta?

281
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,280
Did you think you were going to hog all the glory?

282
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,020
Keep dreaming.

283
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,620
Holy crap, Leo.

284
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:39,380
Looks like you got a lot taller.

285
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:40,720
Well, duh.

286
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:42,280
Look who my brother and sister are.

287
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:44,080
Awesome is just in my genes.

288
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:46,760
So lucky!

289
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:49,380
I'm gonna head out now.

290
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:51,640
I marked this place, so I'll be back soon.

291
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:53,520
Thanks for the help, Finral.

292
00:16:53,620 --> 00:16:54,140
See you then!

293
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,860
Seems everything went well.

294
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:02,160
We just received word that they were successful in taking control of the base.

295
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,720
And they did even better than I could have expected.

296
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,240
That was impressive.

297
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,560
True, but still.

298
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,000
Yes, I know.

299
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:13,500
The real battle has yet to begin.

300
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,340
Is the fighting over?

301
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,140
Can we leave now?

302
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,280
Are the soldiers all gone?

303
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:23,960
We're saved.

304
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,380
What about our village?

305
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,720
What will you do to it?

306
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:28,320
Huh?

307
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:29,900
What do you mean, do?

308
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:35,000
I mean, the ones who just seized control, they're all with you, aren't they?

309
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:37,560
And you came here from the Clover Kingdom.

310
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:41,120
We have to obey the strong if we want to survive.

311
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,480
That's the way things work, isn't it?

312
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:46,560
Oh, we won't do anything.

313
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:48,300
That's your village.

314
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,400
Do what you want with it.

315
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:56,300
Our friend, Finral, he's going to make sure everyone gets back safely, so hang tight.

316
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:57,440
Wow, really?

317
00:17:57,940 --> 00:17:58,740
We're free.

318
00:17:58,840 --> 00:17:59,680
And they won't take Armana?

319
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:00,940
Thank goodness.

320
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:03,080
We're so grateful, sir.

321
00:18:03,660 --> 00:18:05,420
Yeah, thanks for being so nice.

322
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:06,140
No problem.

323
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:09,260
We just want to stop the devil that's hiding in the Spade Kingdom.

324
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:10,240
The devil?

325
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:19,400
Oh, well, you see, as it stands right now, our nation is governed by the Dark Triad, and

326
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:23,360
they've bestowed power upon another group below them called the Dark Disciples.

327
00:18:26,020 --> 00:18:28,880
Believe me, sir, they're extremely strong.

328
00:18:29,740 --> 00:18:34,440
Rumor has it the Dark Triad are every bit as fearsome as devils themselves.

329
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:36,060
Oh, man.

330
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:37,620
That sounds bad.

331
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:51,580
It appears as though you've gotten quite comfortable with wielding the devil's power,

332
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:52,660
Xenob.

333
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:53,520
Yes.

334
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:54,780
Mostly.

335
00:18:55,660 --> 00:18:58,540
We've received reports that our outlying base has fallen.

336
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:03,040
The same happened to Kondalo, the mobile fortress we sent toward the Heart Kingdom.

337
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:05,680
Let's not worry about that.

338
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:09,680
Our soldiers need something to keep them occupied anyway.

339
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:12,480
Dante, what's the deal?

340
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,800
Why does Xenon get all the fun?

341
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:18,500
You let him go to Diamond all by himself, too.

342
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:21,360
Because I was better suited for that assignment.

343
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:22,640
So?

344
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:24,180
What's your point?

345
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:27,300
You only used about 40% of your power that time.

346
00:19:27,760 --> 00:19:30,900
I'm capable of the exact same thing, thank you very much.

347
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:32,860
Come on, guys.

348
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:35,260
When are you going to let me do something interesting?

349
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:39,180
You have improved quite a bit, Vanica.

350
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,680
That's right.

351
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,240
So let me prove it.

352
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:43,460
Yes.

353
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:44,400
You are ready.

354
00:19:44,940 --> 00:19:46,680
And it's time to make our move.

355
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:48,260
Yay!

356
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:48,960
Finally!

357
00:19:49,340 --> 00:19:50,920
I get to eat my treat.

358
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:53,280
I've been saving that thing for so long.

359
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:54,360
But no more.

360
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:57,480
So why did we wait for half a year?

361
00:19:58,320 --> 00:20:01,480
We needed to be fully prepared for the events to come.

362
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,980
After all, what would be the fun in letting the game end swiftly?

363
00:20:05,820 --> 00:20:08,880
We're going to wipe out this entire world.

364
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,720
All sense of order.

365
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:12,300
Mankind's successes.

366
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:13,720
Nature's beauty.

367
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:16,400
Everything will be meaningless.

368
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:20,760
The keys we need to open the door are well within our reach.

369
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:24,160
You mean the arcane stage mages?

370
00:20:24,420 --> 00:20:27,060
There is no possible salvation for them now.

371
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:33,120
At this point, we hold existence itself in the palms of our hands.

372
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:44,060
Ostazov in another land doing his best.

373
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:45,260
What'd he say?

374
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:48,600
I think the big battle's going to start soon.

375
00:20:50,120 --> 00:20:53,280
Oh my, it's getting cloudy.

376
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,400
Sir, what happened?

377
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,940
Please, Lord Yuno.

378
00:21:06,940 --> 00:21:12,640
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful.

379
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,760
Beautiful, beautiful.

