Comparing Heights

396
00:22:45,940 --> 00:22:46,940
Check it, Asta!

397
00:22:46,940 --> 00:22:48,940
I've really grown a lot lately!

398
00:22:48,940 --> 00:22:49,940
Yeah, it's great and all,

399
00:22:49,940 --> 00:22:51,940
But I feel like I might have grown a little bit too

400
00:22:51,940 --> 00:22:53,940
If you look at me super close!

401
00:22:53,940 --> 00:22:55,940
We're pretty much the same height now,

402
00:22:55,940 --> 00:22:57,940
So there's no reason to brag about stuff like that!

403
00:22:57,940 --> 00:22:59,940
Come on, that's ridiculous!

404
00:22:59,940 --> 00:23:01,940
Let's compare, shall we?

405
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:02,940
See?

406
00:23:02,940 --> 00:23:03,940
I'm taller!

407
00:23:04,940 --> 00:23:06,940
Asta needs me to help him!

408
00:23:06,940 --> 00:23:08,940
I know just what to do!

409
00:23:11,940 --> 00:23:12,940
There we go!

410
00:23:12,940 --> 00:23:14,940
We're basically the same size now!

411
00:23:14,940 --> 00:23:15,940
How did you do that?

412
00:23:15,940 --> 00:23:17,940
I'm glad I could make him happy!

413
00:23:17,940 --> 00:23:20,940
While I'm at it,why stop at a tie, right?

414
00:23:22,940 --> 00:23:23,940
Eat that,Leo!

415
00:23:23,940 --> 00:23:26,940
Now I'm way taller than you'll ever be!

416
00:23:26,940 --> 00:23:28,940
At first I thought you had been eating your veggies,

417
00:23:28,940 --> 00:23:31,940
But turns out you're just standing on them!

418
00:23:31,940 --> 00:23:33,940
Oopsie daisy!

419
00:23:34,940 --> 00:23:35,940
Leo!

420
00:23:35,940 --> 00:23:37,940
Who said you could grow without me?

421
00:23:37,940 --> 00:23:39,940
It has been six months!

422
00:23:39,940 --> 00:23:40,940
I've also grown a lot!

423
00:23:40,940 --> 00:23:41,940
Hey!

424
00:23:41,940 --> 00:23:43,940
My eyes are up here, buddy!

